questions.stem_md:
A poster program changes the case of every letter of a slogan and builds a new string one character at a time. Write its exact output.

```python
t = "Go Pune 24"
r = ""
for ch in t:
    if ch.isupper():
        r = r + ch.lower()
    elif ch.islower():
        r = r + ch.upper()
    else:
        r = r + ch
print(r)
```

answer.model_answer_md:
```python
pw = input()
has_digit = False
has_upper = False
has_lower = False
for ch in pw:
    if ch.isdigit():
        has_digit = True
    elif ch.isupper():
        has_upper = True
    elif ch.islower():
        has_lower = True
if len(pw) >= 8 and has_digit and has_upper and has_lower:
    print("Strong")
else:
    print("Weak")
```

